WEBVTT

01:34.520 --> 01:35.987
Oh, the water's so nice!

01:44.797 --> 01:48.367
I had no idea they had a secret hot
spring like this in the jungle!

01:48.367 --> 01:49.834
But...

01:59.445 --> 02:01.480
There are no girls here.

02:01.480 --> 02:04.116
Are you saying this is like a martini
without an olive?

02:04.116 --> 02:07.686
Nope, this is like a martini that
is just an olive with no drink!

02:07.686 --> 02:09.847
Excuse me, but you do have
any dried plums?

02:12.891 --> 02:15.928
By the way, I haven't seen you guys
around here before.

02:15.928 --> 02:17.486
Where you headed?

02:17.896 --> 02:19.365
Adonis.

02:19.365 --> 02:21.066
Don't kid around.

02:21.066 --> 02:23.193
That town is under the control
of the Demon of Time.

02:25.637 --> 02:27.940
Anyone who enters that town

02:27.940 --> 02:30.932
is forced to adhere to an extremely
strict time code.

02:31.977 --> 02:36.315
They are under the constant pressure
and restraint of time,

02:36.315 --> 02:42.345
and never allowed even a second
to relax or complain.

02:53.499 --> 02:56.332
Is that the so-called Demon of Time?

02:56.735 --> 02:58.437
That is the Clock Tower.

02:58.437 --> 03:00.172
The Demon of Time is just a myth

03:00.172 --> 03:02.538
used to describe their
horrible situation.

03:06.211 --> 03:07.413
Wait a minute!

03:07.413 --> 03:10.246
I must warn you against
going to that town!

03:11.750 --> 03:15.354
That town holds the legendary
Grapes of Time, doesn't it?

03:15.354 --> 03:17.623
I have always wanted to taste
their sweet nectar.

03:17.623 --> 03:19.091
You can't be serious!

03:19.091 --> 03:20.581
That's not something they walk
around selling in the streets!

03:20.959 --> 03:23.189
I know, I wouldn't expect any less.

03:24.530 --> 03:27.124
Who the hell is that little kid?

03:27.933 --> 03:32.597
The Adonis Capital of Time, Part 1

03:48.954 --> 03:51.422
Hey, I didn't know you made deliveries
all the way out here!

03:52.291 --> 03:53.559
I never did before.

03:53.559 --> 03:55.360
I've been trying to get through
but they're always closed up.

03:55.360 --> 03:56.827
I guess I'll have to try again tomorrow.

04:00.466 --> 04:03.969
Oh, that's right. I should tell you
not to approach the hourglass.

04:03.969 --> 04:06.301
In that area, the flow of time
is incredibly fast.

04:13.912 --> 04:15.379
I see...

04:22.454 --> 04:23.921
Well, here we are.

04:26.458 --> 04:27.925
I'm going to go scope it out first.

04:29.261 --> 04:31.024
Send me a postcard when
you get there, okay?!

04:37.302 --> 04:40.635
What happened? They don't
sell stamps over there?

04:41.373 --> 04:43.775
You are exactly two hours, thirty-seven
minutes and twenty-nine seconds

04:43.775 --> 04:47.973
past the time we stopped allowing
visitors for today.

04:50.048 --> 04:51.717
I thought you were just a statue.

04:51.717 --> 04:56.088
I was simply posing as a statue in
order to secretly observe you.

04:56.088 --> 04:58.257
We can make no exceptions!

04:58.257 --> 05:00.392
If you are even one second late,
we cannot allow you to enter!

05:00.392 --> 05:01.827
That doesn't pertain to me though.

05:01.827 --> 05:03.294
I think I'm going to go ahead
if you don't mind.

05:04.263 --> 05:05.730
What the?

05:06.598 --> 05:09.067
Please, be our guest.

05:09.067 --> 05:09.334
Thanks for your permission.
Please, be our guest.

05:09.334 --> 05:10.869
Thanks for your permission.

05:10.869 --> 05:12.037
You'll soon be caught in our web.

05:12.037 --> 05:13.504
Here we go!

05:17.309 --> 05:19.539
How's that?! You poor bum!

05:25.651 --> 05:27.986
How the hell?!

05:27.986 --> 05:32.320
Did the Clock of Adonis never
predict this intrusion?

05:32.791 --> 05:34.759
Hey guys, I'd hurry up and
close up if I were you.

05:35.227 --> 05:37.229
You don't want just anyone walking
through those gates, do you?

05:37.229 --> 05:41.131
Five seconds! No, I'll rip him apart
in three seconds!

05:49.174 --> 05:51.108
You guys are too worried about time.

05:51.843 --> 05:53.333
Go ahead and take as long you need
to rest after that one.

06:09.928 --> 06:11.953
That's it. They're in there.

06:12.531 --> 06:14.032
I wonder if it's the proper time
to eat the special grapes?

06:14.032 --> 06:16.933
What? What's that?

06:17.803 --> 06:19.395
It's a...

06:36.455 --> 06:38.790
Everyone! Don't close your eyes!

06:38.790 --> 06:39.925
Mr. Executioner...

06:39.925 --> 06:41.059
What?

06:41.059 --> 06:43.527
Be careful not to cut my braids.

06:44.129 --> 06:47.758
Didn't Master Gear tell you
not to cut my braids?

06:48.300 --> 06:50.869
If you're not careful, I'll cut
that busy tongue of yours

06:50.869 --> 06:52.769
into a thousand pieces!

06:53.405 --> 06:56.897
Hey! What the?! Stop it!

07:03.649 --> 07:05.708
Is her crime being too beautiful?

07:07.686 --> 07:08.920
You've got it all wrong.

07:08.920 --> 07:10.820
She is being punished for
the crime of tardiness.

07:11.189 --> 07:14.989
By tardiness, do you mean like
being late to work or class?

07:15.994 --> 07:17.461
You must be joking!

07:19.331 --> 07:23.631
I don't have time for stupid jokes like
this. Not even for one second!

07:29.908 --> 07:32.240
This is for real?

07:32.878 --> 07:35.312
In this town, tardiness is
the most serious of...

07:36.281 --> 07:38.340
Most serious of what?

07:39.951 --> 07:42.120
The most serious of crimes...

07:42.120 --> 07:43.388
And this is what happens
to those who...

07:43.388 --> 07:46.591
Many hundreds have already
been punished...

07:46.591 --> 07:47.993
Just for being late...

07:47.993 --> 07:52.054
Why are you guys trailing off?
Can't you complete a sentence?

07:52.497 --> 07:55.400
It's the law. We're not allowed to
discuss it with any strangers.

07:55.400 --> 07:57.936
We're punished if we're more
than five seconds late.

07:57.936 --> 07:59.705
Why don't you protest the law?

07:59.705 --> 08:01.935
That is the worst crime in town
and it is always punished.

08:02.541 --> 08:07.646
What? Are you saying I only have five
seconds left to hit on that girl?

08:07.646 --> 08:10.012
I can't even do that?

08:11.616 --> 08:13.083
Kir!

08:16.722 --> 08:18.690
It's Master Gear!

08:20.525 --> 08:21.992
Master Gear?

08:27.933 --> 08:29.423
Time is money.

08:29.968 --> 08:32.804
Who has committed this heinous crime,

08:32.804 --> 08:34.635
and caused me to come
all the way out here?!

08:39.044 --> 08:41.308
For interrupting, you and your pet
shall suffer the same fate!

08:47.419 --> 08:49.444
I see. That's enough for now.

08:49.921 --> 08:53.721
It shall read "Killed For Being Late"
on your tombstone, boy!

08:54.426 --> 08:56.951
Even if you are only one second late!

08:58.563 --> 09:00.428
You got it wrong. He's the one
who is my pet!

09:02.300 --> 09:04.768
I'm the one in charge here.

09:15.747 --> 09:17.180
Well, let's go,

09:17.549 --> 09:19.016
Boss...

09:24.856 --> 09:26.414
Kir Royale!

09:31.263 --> 09:35.801
These foolish games are a waste
of time for me. Got it!

09:35.801 --> 09:37.268
Sherry!

09:39.337 --> 09:42.363
I'm not sure what that is,
but it sure is fast.

09:43.642 --> 09:45.109
Kir Royale!

10:05.096 --> 10:08.725
She deflected the Kir Royale attack?!

10:23.448 --> 10:26.076
Hey, hey, you need a break already?

10:28.520 --> 10:30.351
I suppose I can let you
walk out like that.

10:30.622 --> 10:32.023
I will have mercy on you,

10:32.023 --> 10:34.651
so I don't have to waste
any more of my time.

10:35.527 --> 10:36.994
Never forget my benevolence!

10:45.604 --> 10:46.805
Did we kill him?

10:46.805 --> 10:48.500
No, they have simply run away.

10:49.374 --> 10:52.611
Master Gear, whoever they are, they
defeated the gate guards earlier

10:52.611 --> 10:54.135
and forced their way into the city.

10:54.613 --> 10:55.614
I know.

10:55.614 --> 10:57.309
We will begin a search, and
capture them right away, Sir!

11:21.006 --> 11:24.339
It is useless to try and run from us.
We will find you soon.

11:24.776 --> 11:29.179
I can feel and hear where your
scared hearts are running.

11:29.681 --> 11:32.514
Everyone has their own internal
clock called a heart.

11:32.884 --> 11:35.409
But it is a very fragile thing...

11:40.692 --> 11:42.159
Over there!

11:44.562 --> 11:46.631
How did they know where we were?

11:46.631 --> 11:48.098
I don't know!

12:12.657 --> 12:14.682
Those idiots, they missed!

12:15.660 --> 12:19.965
I figured out how they knew
where we were.

12:19.965 --> 12:21.666
Really?

12:21.666 --> 12:23.133
Now I know how to fight back.

12:31.710 --> 12:33.940
There were two heartbeats before,
but one of them has disappeared.

12:34.346 --> 12:35.608
Did they split up?

12:36.214 --> 12:39.547
Perhaps, because there would be two
heartbeats if they were together.

12:40.185 --> 12:42.210
I'm sure about that, but...

12:42.887 --> 12:45.617
If they have separated, we cannot
use our special attack.

12:45.991 --> 12:47.925
We have to trust our men to find them.

12:53.798 --> 12:55.265
What the?!

12:56.401 --> 12:57.869
Sorry 'bout that.

12:57.869 --> 13:01.539
We joined together and synchronized
our heartbeats so that...

13:01.539 --> 13:02.107
Kir!
We joined together and synchronized
our heartbeats so that...

13:02.107 --> 13:03.074
Kir!

13:03.074 --> 13:04.409
How did they...

13:04.409 --> 13:06.570
We can wait for their explanation later.

13:10.715 --> 13:13.878
Sorry, I should learn to keep my
big beak shut sometimes!

13:18.990 --> 13:20.457
Over here!

13:21.426 --> 13:22.893
Quickly!

13:36.474 --> 13:38.276
Thanks for your help.

13:38.276 --> 13:43.509
No, you were the ones who saved me.
I owe you a debt of gratitude.

13:43.948 --> 13:47.852
Wait, I just want to make sure
you got things straight.

13:47.852 --> 13:50.252
I was the one who saved you!

13:51.022 --> 13:53.513
I guess you're right, thanks.

13:59.464 --> 14:02.300
Sorry, we haven't even introduced
ourselves yet.

14:02.300 --> 14:06.293
My name is Jing. This is
my keeper, Kir.

14:06.838 --> 14:08.373
My name is Mirabelle.

14:08.373 --> 14:12.571
Mirabelle, Mirabelle, mi amore!

14:15.480 --> 14:16.947
Well...

14:17.515 --> 14:20.118
This looks like the entrance
to Hell, doesn't it?

14:20.118 --> 14:21.949
Yeah, maybe it's an omen.

14:25.623 --> 14:27.921
Is this when all the mummies
come out and get us?

14:28.793 --> 14:31.762
If you feel like keeling over, we have
plenty of empty caskets.

14:32.397 --> 14:34.126
Who goes there?!

14:38.336 --> 14:43.137
Watch your voice! Many spirits are
sleeping here quietly in peace.

14:46.845 --> 14:48.813
Welcome to Neverland!

14:48.813 --> 14:51.549
Captain! You're alive!

14:51.549 --> 14:53.218
You know this guy?

14:53.218 --> 14:55.620
The Captain was sentenced to the
death penalty for being late,

14:55.620 --> 14:57.322
just like I was.

14:57.322 --> 15:00.348
But he got away. Oh, I'm so glad!

15:01.025 --> 15:04.392
Just like I was? You were convicted
of the same crime as me?

15:04.963 --> 15:08.228
Yes, but Kir and Jing saved me.

15:10.735 --> 15:12.202
Damn you!

15:13.037 --> 15:14.639
Hey, watch your mouth!

15:14.639 --> 15:16.402
He wasn't talking to us.

15:17.041 --> 15:18.009
Master Gear?

15:18.009 --> 15:21.412
Maybe, but I think he was mad for not
being able to save her himself.

15:21.412 --> 15:22.845
I see.

15:23.248 --> 15:25.550
Hey, by the way, I don't suppose you
guys have any food down here?

15:25.550 --> 15:28.353
I'm really hungry.

15:28.353 --> 15:30.617
If food is what you want...

15:45.603 --> 15:50.233
Don't be too surprised. This is
the main dish of Neverland.

15:50.642 --> 15:52.677
This stuff keeps us alive down here.

15:52.677 --> 15:55.780
The only thing that
surprises me is that

15:55.780 --> 15:58.271
before we came down here, I didn't
even see the likes of one weed.

15:59.784 --> 16:02.353
This smell. A long time ago,

16:02.353 --> 16:05.186
this flower used to bloom in
abundance all over Adonis.

16:06.057 --> 16:08.693
But then Master Gear built
the Clock Tower,

16:08.693 --> 16:12.060
and took over control of all of the
clocks in town, and since then...

16:13.131 --> 16:16.568
Neverland is the only place where
flowers are blooming right now.

16:16.568 --> 16:18.502
We are forced to live
in the graveyard,

16:18.903 --> 16:22.771
and watch as our comrades above
all continue to die slowly.

16:23.274 --> 16:24.764
This is the only place
where it still exists,

16:25.710 --> 16:27.478
the energy and liveliness of our town

16:27.478 --> 16:28.968
at the time when the flowers
bloomed in the plaza.

16:42.560 --> 16:44.062
I have just begun to sense

16:44.062 --> 16:45.529
they will soon begin attempting
to come out from their cells.

16:46.231 --> 16:48.333
I want to leave some room in my
stomach, but I'm getting hungry.

16:48.333 --> 16:50.961
We should have them all
back here before dawn.

17:01.079 --> 17:03.479
Long ago, I desired to bring down
Master Gear with one foul blow.

17:03.982 --> 17:06.849
We were always rioting.

17:09.988 --> 17:12.923
But the number of his victims
just continued to grow.

17:17.462 --> 17:20.625
As the leader, responsible
for everyone's lives,

17:21.065 --> 17:24.523
I decided to stop fighting long ago.

17:27.138 --> 17:28.706
We really have no choice!

17:28.706 --> 17:30.970
It is the only way we can go on living!

17:31.376 --> 17:34.277
Hey, you don't need to
explain yourself to us.

17:34.912 --> 17:38.643
If you think that's the right thing
to do, what's the problem?

17:39.117 --> 17:40.584
I guess you're right.

17:41.119 --> 17:42.848
I'm sorry for getting all worked up.

17:44.489 --> 17:45.956
Mirabelle!

17:56.634 --> 17:58.101
Crocodile!

18:00.104 --> 18:04.438
Whoa, I haven't seen your face
in a while. Weren't you killed?

18:08.746 --> 18:13.149
Don't worry! It will all be over soon.

18:13.751 --> 18:15.878
I'm opening up wide...

18:16.621 --> 18:18.088
What?!

18:21.392 --> 18:24.228
I can't let you take her.
We have a date coming up.

18:24.228 --> 18:27.598
Oh, really? Not if I have anything
to do with it!

18:27.598 --> 18:30.567
The next place you guys meet
will be in Heaven!

18:44.148 --> 18:45.615
Kir Royale!

18:49.721 --> 18:52.890
My skin is so thick that

18:52.890 --> 18:54.858
that felt like no more than a baby
blowing on my face!

18:55.360 --> 18:57.021
That's too bad.

18:59.630 --> 19:01.825
Well, I guess these guys
won't be needing these.

19:02.734 --> 19:04.201
Give me your best shot!

19:04.502 --> 19:05.764
But I'll give it a try anyway.

19:08.706 --> 19:11.937
Good! That's it! Struggle
for all you're worth!

19:16.381 --> 19:18.042
Kir Royale!

19:20.551 --> 19:24.510
Where do you think you're aiming?!
You really missed that time!

19:26.090 --> 19:28.058
What's that, coming from behind?!

19:47.345 --> 19:49.580
What kind of plan is that?!

19:49.580 --> 19:51.639
If we do that, Master Gear will...

19:51.983 --> 19:54.816
Hold on, let me explain.

19:55.219 --> 19:58.222
I'll let your bravery lead you
to certain death,

19:58.222 --> 19:59.712
but I can not allow you to take
advantage of my people!

20:00.158 --> 20:04.060
Master Gear is sure to set fire
to all of these tunnels!

20:04.896 --> 20:05.730
You're wrong!

20:05.730 --> 20:08.790
Kir and Jing are trying to help us
get our freedom back!

20:09.367 --> 20:10.435
What's going on?

20:10.435 --> 20:14.539
Dear Master Gear, I'm going to steal
all time from Adonis.

20:14.539 --> 20:16.006
Sincerely, the Bandit King.

20:16.641 --> 20:18.575
You guys are bandits?

20:18.910 --> 20:19.677
You could say that.

20:19.677 --> 20:21.012
Well, then...

20:21.012 --> 20:25.049
I know I am already your
hero and everything,

20:25.049 --> 20:27.745
but this guy can't do it all by himself,
so I'm going to help.

20:32.190 --> 20:33.714
What is this talk of heroes?

20:34.559 --> 20:36.194
Just look at this lid!

20:36.194 --> 20:38.996
This is what happened when
his time was stopped.

20:38.996 --> 20:43.228
This is what it means to
interrupt time, to die!

20:44.302 --> 20:46.293
What will you so-called heroes do

20:46.704 --> 20:49.104
if you cause this mark to spread
all over town?!

20:49.540 --> 20:51.405
Well?! What will you do then?!

20:52.376 --> 20:54.674
We will cut time in half,
and stop it in its tracks.

20:56.247 --> 20:59.375
You are thinking just as Master Gear
wants you to.

21:18.102 --> 21:20.002
You mustn't look at those lids
as warnings and bad omens,

21:21.272 --> 21:25.538
but as hope for a future without
the tyranny of time!
